340	    // The supplied tag must decode to exactly 32 bytes (64 hex characters);
341	    // decodeHex already rejects empty input, odd length, non-hex characters
342	    // and whitespace, which also rules out a 0x prefix. The submitted tag is
343	    // deliberately not echoed back.
